		{
			dependencies: ["1AA68223242ECD8C"]
			description: [
				"When it comes to moving fluids, you need to use Gregtech pipes. These have various variables to them, but the most important right now are the &l&cheat capacity&r and the &l&o&bfluid transfer rate.&r The pipe you should for water should be treated wood, and use bronze for the steam for now."
				""
				"Another mechanic that is very relevant to the primitive pump is that output hatches will automatically output to the pipe they are connected to."
			]
			id: "09DCF85E9679FFE3"
			subtitle: "Yes, even moving fluids is gregified"
			tasks: [{
				id: "2875B59B86B0989B"
				title: "Pipes?"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			x: -27.5d
			y: 3.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["694D21DD359391F9"]
			description: ["The forge hammer will allow for plates to be made at a 3-2 ratio, instead of a 2-1 (As a tip from gregger to gregger, 9 ingots is 6 plates. That one helped me a lot. Or maybe i'm just dumb, who knows.)"]
			id: "6E52D3FAEFF8D5C1"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{
				id: "6FE482C30C75281D"
				item: "kubejs:ulv_loot_bag"
