			x: -22.0d
			y: 5.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["694D21DD359391F9"]
			description: [
				"The macerator is your first instance of ore processing. This will be greatly expanded later on, but right now, you can throw all of your raw ores in the macerator, and they will &l&6Double.&r"
				""
				"The macerator can also be used to replace the mortars you used to make the copper and tin dust."
				""
				"Macerators infamously use so little power that you can run an HV macerator on 1 amp of LV. All this means for you is that you can run quite a few macerators off of very little steam."
			]
			id: "45575EE69718E395"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{
				id: "2209AEFAEC05C521"
				item: "kubejs:ulv_loot_bag"
