		{
			dependencies: ["694D21DD359391F9"]
			description: ["Did you happen to run across any rubber trees while you were searching for ore veins? if you didn't grab any of them, i would reccomend you go back and do so, becasue you need the &o&6sticky resin &rthat the trees drop, and then put them in this extractor machine."]
